      "item": "CONFIG",
      "reviewed": true,
      "intent": "Define the Python language configuration for tree_path resolution: register tree-sitter-python grammar, .py/.pyi extensions, kind mappings for fn (function_definition), class (class_definition), and const (assignment) for module-level constants, use the standard name field for fn/class and the python_node_name callback for const, the python_has_doc_comment detector for triple-quoted docstrings, and expression_statement as a transparent kind so the resolver reaches module-level assignment nodes.",
